name: sim.getDistanceHandle
description: 
luaSynopsis: int distanceObjectHandle=sim.getDistanceHandle(string distanceObjectName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. distanceObjectName: name of distance object. If the name is appended by a "@silentError" suffix, then no error will be output if the distance object does not exist.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. handle of the distance object or -1 if operation was not successful
